        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Liam Cunningham, Michael Fassbender, Nick Reding, Keith Barron\n- Works: Police 2020\n- Roles: DCI Billy O'Connell, Eddie Longshaw\n- Topics: Irish actors, television and film appearances\n\nFacts:\n- Liam Cunningham, born on 2 June 1961, is an Irish stage and screen actor.\n- Michael Fassbender, born on 2 April 1977, is an Irish actor.\n- In the near-future pilot Police 2020, Liam Cunningham starred as DCI Billy O'Connell, the head of a police nightshift force.\n- In Police 2020, DCI Billy O'Connell is tasked with tackling armed suspect Eddie Longshaw.\n- In Police 2020, Keith Barron played Eddie Longshaw.\n- In Police 2020, Eddie Longshaw takes a group of Russian immigrants hostage in an elevator after blaming immigrants for a tuberculosis outbreak that killed most of his family.\n- Nick Reding's television and film appearances include Police 2020, The Monocled Mutineer, Bodyguards, Oscar, Peak Practice, Minder, Tales from the Crypt, A Touch of Frost, Croupier, The Constant Gardener, Blood Diamond, and Soul Boy.",
